                  },
                  "htmlTag": "",
                  "htmlContainerPath": "",
                  "cssClasses": ""
                },
                {
                  "id": "p2-e48",
                  "text": "After checking out of our hotel we enjoy a guided tour at the Palais des Beaux Arts at Lille, considered by many to be one of France\u2019s most important galleries. Taking carefully selected comfort stops en route, we return to Calais for our return Eurotunnel crossing to Folkestone, and onwards coach travel back to our original pick up point.",
                  "fontSize": 10.5,
                  "fontName": "ADABMA\u002BHelveticaNeue",
                  "color": "#221F1F",
                  "boundingBox": {
                    "left": 212.6,
