                    "width": 336.6,
                    "height": 61.1
                  },
                  "htmlTag": "",
                  "htmlContainerPath": "",
                  "cssClasses": ""
                },
                {
                  "id": "p2-e49",
                  "text": "NB:- Due to regulations in Bruges, coaches have restricted access within the city centre.",
                  "fontSize": 8,
                  "fontName": "ADABKN\u002BHelveticaNeue-Medium",
                  "color": "#16549D",
                  "boundingBox": {
                    "left": 213.3,
                    "top": 109.2,
                    "width": 326.3,
                    "height": 5.7
                  },
                  "htmlTag": "",
                  "htmlContainerPath": "",
                  "cssClasses": ""
                },
                {
                  "id": "p2-e50",
                  "text": "On the first and last days of the tour, the coach will drop us off at a designated point which is less than a three minute walk away from the hotel. Porterage between the coach and hotel is included in the cost of the tour (one piece of luggage per person). Please note we reserve the right to alter the above itinerary if required for operational reasons. Given the historic nature of the places visited, a certain degree of walking will be involved, and this holiday may not be suitable for those with mobility problems.",
                  "fontSize": 8,
